      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Ouro Station: information about <color=red>Solar Exhaust</color>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Due to variations in workload and components, certain Hardlight Lattices
        may produce Solar Exhaust as a byproduct.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: Once these Lattices are operational, Solar Exhaust will be emitted by
        projection ports, which may crystallize into photovoltaic artifacts.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: Light Exhaust artifacts are unpredictable. Caution is advised in their
        proximity.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
