    - target: {fileID: 3568279510395790758, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: OuroDesk (1)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Ouro Station: information about <color=red>Calibration Drones</color>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Calibration Drones are Station administrative tools capable of recalibrating
        Hardlight Lattices.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: The Drones emit an ultra-low-frequency pulse that is capable of resolving
        Lattice nodes that are in error states.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: By resolving all nodes, the Drone can recalibrate the entire Hardlight
        Lattice.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Ouro Station: information about <color=red>Hardlight Lattices</color>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Hardlight Lattices are the fundamental photovoltaic production units
        of Ouro Station's hardlight supply chain.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: Lattices subject raw incoming light to a series of reflectance inversions,
        converting it into a form that is usable by hardlight systems.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: Hardlight Lattices must be carefully calibrated to ensure the inversion
        passes are precise.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    m_RemovedComponents: []
    m_RemovedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedGameObjects: []
    m_AddedComponents: []
  m_SourcePrefab: {fileID: 100100000, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322, type: 3}
