    - target: {fileID: 3568279510395790758, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: OuroDesk
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Ouro Station: information about <color=red>Hardlight Cores</color>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Ouro Station's most critical piece of hardware is its Hardlight Core,
        which consolidates the output of the entire Station into a single stream.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4231613405445098863, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: The Hardlight Core is dependent on Hardlight Lattices. Disruptions in
        the Lattices subsequently will interrupt the Core's hardlight production.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.size
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].resetDialogueIndex
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[2].resetDialogueIndex
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[0].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'Ouro Station: information about <color=red>Ouro Station</color>.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: Welcome to Ouro Station. This facility is the world's principal solar
        intake, supplying energy and hardlight functionality to various systems across
        the Mountain.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[1]'
      value: Ouro Station's hardlight output supports the operation of Hardlight
        Bridges, which connect disparate regions of the Mountain.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[1].texts.Array.data[2]'
      value: The Station thus plays a critical role in keeping the upper Mountain
        regions accessible from the lower Steppe.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogues.Array.data[2].texts.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7469352857668880163, guid: 468af67931aaa4fbb84a1e621067c322,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogues.Array.data[1].advanceDialogueIndex
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
